     <item>
      <widget class="QLabel" name="about_files_label">
       <property name="text">
        <string>• The list of recordings comes from the slow wave characteristics files.&lt;br/&gt;• Snooz finds the sleep stages file and the rows of the cohort report of each recording by its name. Keep the names written by "Detect Slow Waves".&lt;br/&gt;• For example, with slow wave events named sw_carrier, learn-nsrr01_sw_carrier.tsv goes with learn-nsrr01_sw_carrier_stages.tsv and with the rows of learn-nsrr01 in the cohort report.&lt;br/&gt;• The cohort report must hold the slow waves of a single event name.&lt;br/&gt;• Before the classification, Snooz checks the files and lists the missing ones.</string>
       </property>
       <property name="textFormat">
        <enum>Qt::TextFormat::RichText</enum>
       </property>
       <property name="wordWrap">
        <bool>true</bool>
       </property>
